'''Jingle Bells''' is a {{Rare}} [[Support item]] that angers nearby mobs.

== Obtaining ==
'''Jingle Bells''' can be obtained by beating the 4th cluckpoint in the [[Chicken Race]]. Once unlocked, it can be purchased from {{NPCSprite|Rusty}} for {{C|1,000,000}}.

== Uses ==
{{ItemInfo
|rarity = rare
|item_ability_name = Jingle Bells
|item_ability_activation = RIGHT CLICK
|item_ability_description = Angers all monsters in a {{Green|10 block}} range, consuming {{Green|50%}} of your total mana and causing them to run towards you.
|item_ability_cooldown = {{Green|1s}}
}}

'''Jingle Bells''' best use is to redirect mobs to the user if their teammates are overwhelmed with mobs, buying time for them to heal. It is also a must item for [[Tank|tanks]] at higher Catacomb Floors.

A good use is at [[Thorn|Thorn Boss Fight]], to lure the [[Thorn#Boss Mobs|spirits animals]] into the fire circle. It can also be used in [[Maxor]], [[Storm]] and [[Necron]] Boss fight to take their aggro in order to lead Maxor to the laser easier, increase the fault tolerance during the process to crush Storm and control Necron's rush direction respectively.

